---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Schedule a Call with Kevin White — Spirit Media Publishing"
	description="Book a free consultation with Kevin White, CEO of Spirit Media Publishing. Let's talk about your book, your message, and your next step."
	ogImage="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/pmowd8uo/production/f67376ca3cbad336ac9ed54977f72d3f9917397b-1200x630.jpg?w=1200&h=630&fit=crop&fm=jpg&q=85"
>
	<Fragment slot="head">
		<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://spiritmediapublishing.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Schedule a Call with Kevin White","item":"https://spiritmediapublishing.com/kevin/"}]})}></script>
		<meta name="keywords" content="Kevin White, schedule call, Spirit Media Publishing, book consultation, Christian publishing, free consultation" />
		<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
			"@context": "https://schema.org",
			"@type": "WebPage",
			"name": "Schedule a Call with Kevin White",
			"description": "Book a free consultation with Kevin White, CEO of Spirit Media Publishing.",
			"url": "https://spiritmediapublishing.com/kevin/",
			"about": { "@id": "https://kevinwhite.us/#person" },
			"publisher": { "@type": "Organization", "@id": "https://spiritmediapublishing.com/#organization", "name": "Spirit Media Publishing", "url": "https://spiritmediapublishing.com" }
		})}></script>
		{/* 3by: the same Kevin White node as the homepage founder (one @id across both sites). */}
		<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
			"@context": "https://schema.org",
			"@type": "Person",
			"@id": "https://kevinwhite.us/#person",
			"name": "Kevin White",
			"url": "https://kevinwhite.us",
			"jobTitle": "Founder & CEO, Spirit Media Publishing",
			"worksFor": { "@id": "https://spiritmediapublishing.com/#organization" },
			"sameAs": [
				"https://kevinwhite.us",
				"https://kevinwhite.us/about/",
				"https://www.linkedin.com/in/kevinwhiteus/",
				"https://www.youtube.com/@KevinWhiteus",
				"https://www.amazon.com/stores/author/B08LZYTR2B"
			]
		})}></script>
	</Fragment>

	<main id="main-content">
		<!-- CALENDAR EMBED -->
		<section class="bg-white px-6 py-12 lg:py-16 lg:px-8">
			<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
				<h1 class="mb-4 text-center text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink-soft sm:text-4xl">Schedule a Call with Kevin White</h1>
				<p class="mb-8 text-center text-lg text-gray-700">Book a free consultation with Kevin White, CEO of Spirit Media Publishing. Let's talk about your book, your message, and your next step.</p>
				<iframe
					src="https://mail.spiritmediaone.com/widget/booking/JBJZYruuU5JsL9bbL6xv"
					style="width:100%; height:800px; border:none; border-radius:3px;"
					id="msgsndr-booking-JBJZYruuU5JsL9bbL6xv"
					data-layout="{'id':'INLINE'}"
					data-trigger-type="alwaysShow"
					data-trigger-value=""
					data-activation-type="alwaysActivated"
					data-activation-value=""
					data-deactivation-type="neverDeactivate"
					data-deactivation-value=""
					data-form-name="Book a Call with Kevin"
					data-height="800"
					data-layout-iframe-id="msgsndr-booking-JBJZYruuU5JsL9bbL6xv"
					data-form-id="JBJZYruuU5JsL9bbL6xv"
					title="Schedule a call with Kevin White"
				></iframe>
				<script is:inline src="https://mail.spiritmediaone.com/js/form_embed.js"></script>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- 3ih: bio substance. Facts only, all already published on /about/. -->
		<section class="bg-stone-50 border-t border-stone-200 px-6 py-12 lg:py-16 lg:px-8">
			<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
				<p class="text-base font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-red mb-3">About Kevin</p>
				<h2 class="type-section-heading text-ink-soft mb-6">Who You Will Be Talking With</h2>
				<p class="type-body-lg text-stone-700 mb-4">
					Kevin White is the Founder and CEO of Spirit Media Publishing. He is an author, speaker, and marketplace pastor with decades of experience planting churches, leading nonprofits, starting companies, and developing leaders worldwide. That adds up to more than forty years of leadership.
				</p>
				<p class="type-body-lg text-stone-700 mb-4">
					Together with his wife, Shelly, he co-founded and leads Spirit Media and Father's Heart Bible™. As partners in both marriage and mission for nearly forty years, they are committed to empowering Kingdom Messengers. They live in North Carolina with their family. You can read more about them and the team on our <a href="/about/" class="text-red underline">About page</a>.
				</p>

				<h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-ink-soft mt-10 mb-3">Why Spirit Media Exists</h3>
				<p class="type-body-lg text-stone-700 mb-4">
					Spirit Media exists because the Good News was never meant to stop at borders. Too often, vision in publishing has been small, limited to markets instead of nations. But our Heavenly Father is worthy of His story bearing fruit in all 195 nations of the earth. We exist to remove the barriers (the complexity, the cost, the confusion) and to equip Kingdom Messengers with the publishing and marketing solutions they need to multiply Kingdom impact and generational inheritance.
				</p>
				<p class="type-body-lg text-stone-700 mb-4">
					What began as holy frustration became a global mandate. We are here to build sustainable Kingdom movements, amplify our Father's heart, and see His whisper reach every tribe, tongue, and nation. Our mission is to walk with Kingdom Messengers from restoration to proclamation, empowering them from heart to message to movement.
				</p>

				<h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-ink-soft mt-10 mb-3">The Values Behind the Work</h3>
				<p class="type-body-lg text-stone-700 mb-4">
					Everything flows from who God is as Father. We build from intimacy, identity, and inheritance, not insecurity, and we refuse orphan thinking. We operate from covenants, not contracts, and treat every author, partner, and team member like family. We pursue bold vision, trusting our perfect and loving Heavenly Father for outcomes beyond our capacity. We reject mediocrity, because our Father deserves our best. We think nations, not numbers, and we handle every message, resource, and relationship with integrity, wisdom, and long-term Kingdom vision.
				</p>

				<h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-ink-soft mt-10 mb-3">Publishing Track Record</h3>
				<p class="type-body-lg text-stone-700 mb-4">
					Spirit Media Publishing has published <a href="/bookstore/" class="text-red underline">300+ titles</a> across paperback, hardback, digital, and audiobook formats, reaching 163 countries with a mission to all 195 nations. Spirit Media Publishing is the publishing imprint of Spirit Media Inc. Our press releases and video features are in the <a href="/media-center/" class="text-red underline">Media Center</a>, and you can see how we work with authors on our <a href="/publishing/" class="text-red underline">publishing</a> page.
				</p>

				<h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-ink-soft mt-10 mb-3">Father's Heart Bible™</h3>
				<p class="type-body-lg text-stone-700 mb-4">
					Father's Heart Bible™ is an interpretive English translation of the original Hebrew, Aramaic, and Greek, published by Spirit Media Publishing with Kevin White as editor. Learn more on the <a href="/fathers-heart-bible/" class="text-red underline">Father's Heart Bible page</a>.
				</p>

				<h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-ink-soft mt-10 mb-3">A Free Book From Spirit Media</h3>
				<p class="type-body-lg text-stone-700 mb-4">
					Father's Heart → Beloved Identity is a compact book from Spirit Media. Eight billion people are asking the same question: Who am I? Only one voice holds the answer. In this book, your Heavenly Father speaks directly to you, revealing His heart, dismantling the orphan spirit, and establishing your true identity as His beloved child. <a href="/free-book/" class="text-red underline">Get your free copy</a>.
				</p>

				<h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-ink-soft mt-10 mb-3">Find Kevin Elsewhere</h3>
				<p class="type-body-lg text-stone-700">
					<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kevinwhiteus/" rel="me noopener" class="text-red underline">LinkedIn</a> ·
					<a href="https://www.youtube.com/@KevinWhiteus" rel="me noopener" class="text-red underline">YouTube</a> ·
					<a href="https://www.amazon.com/stores/author/B08LZYTR2B" rel="me noopener" class="text-red underline">Amazon author page</a> ·
					<a href="https://kevinwhite.us" rel="me noopener" class="text-red underline">kevinwhite.us</a>
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
